IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ssc-core`
IMPORT `ssc9-sch12-13`

-- Tests for ssc9-sch12-13.l4 (Schedules 12 and 13). Expected values are written by hand from the text, beside each assertion.

§ `Tests -- Schedules 12 and 13`

§§ `Schedule 12`

#ASSERT `sch 12 para 1 the day counts as a day of incapacity for work for incapacity benefit` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 1 the day counts as a day of incapacity for work for incapacity benefit` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 1 the day counts as a day of incapacity for work for incapacity benefit` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2: contractual remuneration of 100 owed for the day; statutory sick pay paid 30 -> 70 still owed; paid 100 -> 0; paid 150 -> 0 (never negative).
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 2(2)(b) the contractual remuneration still owed for the day` 100 30 EQUALS 70
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 2(2)(b) the contractual remuneration still owed for the day` 100 100 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 2(2)(b) the contractual remuneration still owed for the day` 100 150 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 2(2)(b) the contractual remuneration still owed for the day` 100 0 EQUALS 100
-- Statutory sick pay of 16 owed for the day; contractual remuneration paid 10 -> 6 owed; paid 16 or more -> 0.
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 2(2)(a) the statutory sick pay still owed for the day` 16 10 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 2(2)(a) the statutory sick pay still owed for the day` 16 16 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 2(2)(a) the statutory sick pay still owed for the day` 16 40 EQUALS 0
-- 3(2), (3): argument order: the number of the day after the period of entitlement ended; every day from the first meets (a) and (b); prescribed exception.
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 1 TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 2 TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 3 TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 4 TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 0 TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 2 FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 3 FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The first day failing (a) or (b) is the failed "if" of sub-paragraph (2): FALSE (a prescribed case changes nothing for a day that is not deemed).
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 1 FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 1 FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 4 FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 3(2) the day is or forms part of a period of incapacity for work` 1 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 4(1): the 57 days immediately following the day the period of entitlement ended, 1 March 2025: 2 March (1st) to 27 April (57th).
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 4(1) section 30A(3) does not apply to the day` TRUE (Date 2 3 2025) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 4(1) section 30A(3) does not apply to the day` TRUE (Date 27 4 2025) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 4(1) section 30A(3) does not apply to the day` TRUE (Date 28 4 2025) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 4(1) section 30A(3) does not apply to the day` TRUE (Date 1 3 2025) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 4(1) section 30A(3) does not apply to the day` FALSE (Date 2 3 2025) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 4(2) section 30A(3) does not apply to the later day` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 4(2) section 30A(3) does not apply to the later day` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 5 paragraph 1 applies` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 5 paragraph 1 applies` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 6 paragraph 1 applies` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 12 para 6 paragraph 1 applies` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Schedule 13`

#ASSERT `sch 13 para 1 the day counts as a day of incapacity for work for incapacity benefit` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 1 the day counts as a day of incapacity for work for incapacity benefit` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 1 the day counts as a day of incapacity for work for incapacity benefit` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2(2): argument order: the regulations provide for the deduction; benefit rate; statutory maternity pay.
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 2(2) the weekly rate of the benefit after the deduction` TRUE 100 60 EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 2(2) the weekly rate of the benefit after the deduction` TRUE 100 100 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 2(2) the weekly rate of the benefit after the deduction` TRUE 100 150 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 2(2) the weekly rate of the benefit after the deduction` FALSE 100 60 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 3(2A) the meaning of week` EQUALS `a period of 7 days beginning with the day on which a stated period begins`
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 3(2)(b) the contractual remuneration still owed for the week` 300 120 EQUALS 180
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 3(2)(b) the contractual remuneration still owed for the week` 300 400 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 3(2)(a) the statutory maternity pay still owed for the week` 184 100 EQUALS 84
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 3(2)(a) the statutory maternity pay still owed for the week` 184 184 EQUALS 0
